<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Estonian soccer</p>
<p>championship matches played on Saturday.</p>
<p>Lelle Sk	  -FC Marlekor		1:0</p>
<p>FC Lantana	-Tallinna Sadam	   2:0</p>
<p>FC Flora	  -Narva Trans		5:1</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>		   P    W    D    L    F    A    PTS</p>
<p>1. FC Lantana  4    4    0    0    13   1    30</p>
<p>2. FC Flora    5    4    1    0    15   3    28</p>
<p>3. Lelle SK    5    2    0    3     2   9    17</p>
<p>4. FC Marlekor 4    1    0    3     1   10   14</p>
<p>5. Narva Trans 4    1    0    3     3   7    10</p>
<p>6. Sadam	 4    0    1    3     1   5     9</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
